<title>HONG KONG: China Inv 1996 net loss HK$324.98 mln.</title>
<headline>China Inv 1996 net loss HK$324.98 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	 89.0 loss   vs 115.0 loss (adjusted)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)  nil	   vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	284.32 loss vs 329.43 loss</p>
<p>    Net			  324.98 loss vs 372.23 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		   259.12	vs 107.40</p>
<p>    Company name	     China Investments Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	 N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - China Investments is an investment holding and property development firm.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional loss of HK$136.85 million on written off properties under development which have a defect land title, loss of HK$17.42 million on disposal of subsidiaries comprising hotel property interest, loss of HK$10.79 million on provision for doubtful debits and loss of HK$119.27 million on provision for diminution in value of other property interests.</p>
<p>Comparative loss per share has been adjusted for the rights issue during the year.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs nil.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
